
Level Advancement

	There are 50 levels in Assassin.  Each level requires a certain 
amount of experience.   To check for a promotion, use the [N]ext level key
on the main menu.   This will also tell you how much experience you need to
be promoted to the next level.

	For each level advancement you will recieve special bonuses.  These
may be Health, Strength, IQ, Dexterity, Charisma, Toughness or Street Smarts.
(see STATS for a description of these stats!)
 

